      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd love for this to swapped to a long-press. The amount of times stick drift has messed me over because of a single mistake while trying to reset poses have been absolutely awful.\n\nIt'd be a reliever if the \"Reset Avatar\" button was a 'long press' mechanic to further prevent this issue!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
