      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "YES! it genuinely annoys the hell outta me when it happens, not just that but when you have stick drift that makes your joystick click 3 different things at once leading you your avatars being reset. I get we have the \"menu flick\" toggle in the settings so you can press the trigger to select but thats way too slow and it isn't what people are used to. However maybe an \"are you sure you want to reset your avatar\" pop-up could appear.\n\n(Unrelated, but we also need like an in chat log in the mini menu so we can see what people are saying from far away, like being able to create groupchats or just one on one convosations (I'd say it'd have to be highly censored for use because of bad actors but yeah))",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
